DISTRIBUTION SCOPE

This distribution contains the OpenFOAM frontend source, the public
frontend/backend process protocol, an executable-only CUDA numerical backend,
build metadata, documentation, and runnable example cases. Release examples
contain their minimum runnable case state together with scripts and reference
inputs required by Allrun.

CUDA kernel source, CUDA backend server source, CUDA objects, static backend
libraries, backend build logs, runtime logs, calculated time directories, and
post-processing products remain in their respective private build or local run
environments.

